{"id":"616392","name":"青口贝蔬菜温沙拉","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/616392/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西兰花","amount":"1/2颗"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"1/2个"},{"name":"油浸金枪鱼肉","amount":"1罐"},{"name":"青口贝","amount":"6个"}],"sub":[{"name":"甜玉米粒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青豌豆粒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有食材。","img":"images/616392/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西兰花去蒂、切小房，洗净。","img":"images/616392/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆洗净、去皮、切小块，泡清水里。","img":"images/616392/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青口贝刷洗干净，把肉摘下来。","img":"images/616392/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"青豌豆粒","img":"images/616392/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小番茄去蒂、洗净后，对半切开。","img":"images/616392/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"半锅水烧开后，放入土豆和西兰花。","img":"images/616392/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"西兰花变色变软后，先捞出冷却。","img":"images/616392/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"土豆继续煮软。","img":"images/616392/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"中途放入青豆粒。","img":"images/616392/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"青豆粒和土豆都变软后，捞出冷却。","img":"images/616392/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"青口贝放到热水里焯一下。","img":"images/616392/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盘中放入土豆、西兰花，撒入甜玉米粒。","img":"images/616392/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再放入青豆粒和小番茄。","img":"images/616392/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"铺上油浸金枪鱼罐头肉。","img":"images/616392/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"最后放上青口贝。","img":"images/616392/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"食用前浇上青梅口味的沙拉汁即可。","img":"images/616392/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}